{"seq":2,"slug":"drop-tuning","title":"掉落率调校：从设计意图到数据验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/practice/drop-tuning","wordCount":1395,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"掉落率调校-从设计意图到数据验证\">掉落率调校：从设计意图到数据验证</h1><p>「我想让玩家平均刷 30 次副本拿到这把武器」——这是一句设计意图，而把它翻译成掉落表里的一个具体权重、再验证它上线后真的是 30 次而不是 80 次，就是<strong>掉落率调校</strong>（drop tuning）。这一篇讲一套闭环方法论：从意图反推初始参数、用期望值计算预估、用遥测数据验证、用 A/B 实验迭代。它是把前面所有理论落到「手感刚好」的关键一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-调校的闭环\">核心概念：调校的闭环</h2><p>掉落率调校不是拍脑袋填数字，而是一个「意图 → 参数 → 上线 → 观测 → 修正」的闭环。它把设计语言（「感觉太肝了」）翻译成可计算、可测量的数值：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[设计意图&lt;br/&gt;平均 N 次获得·手感描述] --&gt; B[反推初始参数&lt;br/&gt;掉率 p ≈ 1/N]&#10;  B --&gt; C[期望值/方差预估&lt;br/&gt;建模验证]&#10;  C --&gt; D[灰度上线&lt;br/&gt;小流量]&#10;  D --&gt; E[遥测采集&lt;br/&gt;实际掉落分布]&#10;  E --&gt; F{实际 vs 意图偏差?}&#10;  F --&gt;|偏差大| G[调整参数]&#10;  G --&gt; D&#10;  F --&gt;|达标| H[全量上线·持续监控]\">flowchart TD\n  A[设计意图&lt;br/&gt;平均 N 次获得·手感描述] --&gt; B[反推初始参数&lt;br/&gt;掉率 p ≈ 1/N]\n  B --&gt; C[期望值/方差预估&lt;br/&gt;建模验证]\n  C --&gt; D[灰度上线&lt;br/&gt;小流量]\n  D --&gt; E[遥测采集&lt;br/&gt;实际掉落分布]\n  E --&gt; F{实际 vs 意图偏差?}\n  F --&gt;|偏差大| G[调整参数]\n  G --&gt; D\n  F --&gt;|达标| H[全量上线·持续监控]</pre><p>这个闭环的每一步都对应一门具体技术：反推靠概率模型，预估靠期望值计算，验证靠<a href=\"../../game-telemetry-analytics/applied/balance-difficulty-tuning\">遥测与分析</a>，迭代靠 A/B 实验。本篇把这些串成可操作的流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从意图反推初始参数\">从意图反推初始参数</h2><p>调校的起点是把设计意图量化。最常见的意图形式是「平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次获得」，对应几何分布，初始掉率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\approx 1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。但要小心几何分布的方差——单纯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着大量玩家会偏离期望很远：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计意图</th>\n<th>初始掉率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>中位数次数</th>\n<th>90 分位次数</th>\n<th>玩家体感</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平均 10 次</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>尚可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均 30 次</td>\n<td>3.3%</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>68</td>\n<td>尾部玩家已不满</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均 100 次</td>\n<td>1%</td>\n<td>69</td>\n<td>230</td>\n<td>需保底介入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表里 90 分位（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil \\ln(0.1) / \\ln(1-p) \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌉</span></span></span></span></span>）揭示了纯几何分布的残酷：意图「平均 30 次」时，有 10% 的玩家要刷 68 次以上。若这个尾部不可接受，就不能只调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，必须引入<a href=\"../fairness/pity-timers\">保底机制</a>或 <a href=\"../fairness/pseudo-random-distribution\">PRD</a> 把尾部砍掉——这说明调校和公平机制是绑定决策，不能分开做。</p>\n<h2 id=\"期望值计算-上线前的建模\">期望值计算：上线前的建模</h2><p>在灰度之前，应先用期望值（EV）计算把参数的经济与手感后果算清楚，避免上线才发现离谱。核心量有三个：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单次期望产出</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>产出</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{产出}] = \\sum_i p_i v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">产出</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（见<a href=\"loot-economy\">掉落与经济平衡</a>），预估经济注入。</li>\n<li><strong>达成目标的期望次数</strong>：几何分布下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[N] = 1/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>；带保底时用分段积分（见保底篇公式）。</li>\n<li><strong>达成时间</strong>：期望次数 × 单次耗时，判断「肝度」是否符合意图。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对复杂的嵌套掉落表，解析计算容易出错，更稳的是<strong>蒙特卡洛模拟</strong>：用真实抽样代码跑一百万次虚拟掉落，直接统计实际分布。这也顺便验证了<a href=\"../sampling/weighted-random\">加权随机</a>和<a href=\"../sampling/alias-method\">别名法</a>的实现是否正确——如果模拟出的掉率和配置的权重对不上，就是抽样代码有 bug（回想加权随机篇讲的浮点/边界坑）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def monte_carlo_drop_rate(loot_table, target_item, trials=1_000_000):&#10;    hits = sum(1 for _ in range(trials) if sample(loot_table) == target_item)&#10;    return hits / trials   # 应逼近配置的理论掉率\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> monte_carlo_drop_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(loot_table, target_item, trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trials) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sample(loot_table) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trials   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 应逼近配置的理论掉率</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"遥测验证-让数据说话\">遥测验证：让数据说话</h2><p>上线后，真实掉率必须靠遥测验证，因为「配置的掉率」和「玩家实际感受的掉率」可能因为各种原因（条件过滤、玩家行为、bug）而偏离。关键是给每次掉落打点，记录：掉落表 ID、上下文、抽中结果、以及当时的概率。聚合后能回答：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>实际掉率 vs 配置掉率</strong>是否一致（偏差即 bug 信号）。</li>\n<li><strong>达成目标的实际次数分布</strong>（中位数、分位数）是否符合意图。</li>\n<li><strong>不同玩家分群</strong>的掉落体验差异（新手 vs 老手、付费 vs 免费）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>验证掉率是否「统计正确」要用假设检验。若配置掉率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，观测到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次掉落中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次命中，用二项检验判断 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p = k/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是否显著偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.96</mn><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\hat p - p_0| &gt; 1.96\\sqrt{p_0(1-p_0)/n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（95% 置信）时偏差显著，需排查。这类分析的埋点管线、数据仓库、看板搭建，属于<a href=\"../../game-telemetry-analytics/foundations/event-taxonomy-design\">遥测与分析 hub</a>，本篇只讲它服务于掉落调校的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"a-b-实验-迭代的正确姿势\">A/B 实验：迭代的正确姿势</h2><p>当不确定「掉率调 3% 还是 5% 更好」时，正确做法不是拍板，而是 <strong>A/B 实验</strong>：把玩家随机分成对照组和实验组，两组用不同掉率，比较关键指标（留存、时长、付费、投诉率），用数据决定。</p>\n<p>A/B 掉落实验的几个要点：<strong>随机分组要稳定</strong>（同一玩家始终在同一组，用玩家 ID 哈希分组，呼应<a href=\"../foundations/random-vs-deterministic\">随机与确定性奖励</a>的种子派生思想）、<strong>样本量要够</strong>（低频掉落需要很大样本才有统计功效）、<strong>观测周期要足</strong>（掉落对留存的影响往往滞后数天）、<strong>只改一个变量</strong>（同时改掉率和保底就无法归因）。A/B 实验的统计设计与显著性判定，深水区在<a href=\"../../game-telemetry-analytics/applied/ab-testing-liveops\">遥测与分析 · A/B 测试</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>掉落调校是「意图→参数→上线→观测→修正」的闭环，把设计语言翻译成可计算可测量的数值。</li>\n<li>从「平均 N 次」反推 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\approx 1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 只是起点；几何分布的尾部（90 分位远大于均值）常常逼你绑定保底/PRD 一起调。</li>\n<li>上线前用期望值计算和蒙特卡洛模拟建模，模拟还能反过来验证抽样代码是否正确。</li>\n<li>上线后用遥测 + 二项检验验证实际掉率，用 A/B 实验（稳定分组、足够样本、单一变量）迭代决策。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"loot-economy\">掉落与经济平衡</a> —— 期望产出如何影响经济。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../fairness/pity-timers\">保底机制</a> —— 砍掉几何分布尾部的手段。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-telemetry-analytics/applied/balance-difficulty-tuning\">遥测与分析 · 平衡与难度调校</a> —— 数据驱动调参的完整方法。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/tuning/data-driven-tuning\">经济与平衡 · 数据驱动调参</a> —— 更广的数值调校实践。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"掉落率调校：从设计意图到数据验证","id":"掉落率调校-从设计意图到数据验证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：调校的闭环","id":"核心概念-调校的闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"从意图反推初始参数","id":"从意图反推初始参数"},{"level":2,"text":"期望值计算：上线前的建模","id":"期望值计算-上线前的建模"},{"level":2,"text":"遥测验证：让数据说话","id":"遥测验证-让数据说话"},{"level":2,"text":"A/B 实验：迭代的正确姿势","id":"a-b-实验-迭代的正确姿势"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"掉落与经济平衡：作为水龙头的战利品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/practice/loot-economy"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：工程实现、反作弊与合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/practice/loot-tables-in-practice"}}